# Pacing diagnostic (docs/re-curse-battle-speed.md): one round of Jian's Attack in the first
# Delrich Temple battle, Jian cursed (battle ctx 0x020B85B8 +0x5C poked to 1), no fast-forward.
# Logs the round state (battle ctx +0x2E; ctx is the pointer at 0x020B8550, 0x02282940 in this run),
# the actor (+0x32), battler 12's action step (+0xCC), the camera mode (0x020B8578 +0x2C), every
# step start (func_020316e0) and the built-in fast-forward level (0x020B8540).
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8550 battle_ctx
watch u32 0x020B8540 ff_level
watch u16 0x0228296E round_state
watch u16 0x02282972 actor
watch u16 0x0228FC7C b12_step
watch u32 0x020B85A4 camera_mode
exec 0x020316E0 step_start
poke u16 0x020B8614 1
peek u16 0x020B8614 curse
press A 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 900
shot diag_curse_attack_end
